# Fate's Whispers (Q234), up to the pipette knife: a level 75 character accepts at Reorin;
# Cabrio's death leaves the Coffer of the Dead and its Reiria soul orb; the three raid boss
# chests give their infernium scepters; Cliff the varnish, Ferris the hammer; Zenkin sends
# the player to Kaspar, who gives the pipette knife. A blow at Baium with bare hands takes no
# blood, so Kaspar still waits. The crystals, the weapon choice and the knife's blood are in
# tests/quest/q234_flow_test.go (a scenario holds no item). Expectations are derived from the
# reference source (Q234_FatesWhisper.java).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q234_fates_whisper.golden
character Seeker 75
script quest.Q234_FatesWhisper
